# Context Budget

Smaller context = lower cost and better answers.

- **New chat per task.** Do not continue this thread onto unrelated work.
- Past ~8 exchanges or a topic shift → start fresh with only the files you need.
- Never `@Codebase` by default; attach only files you will edit.
- Prefer short agent replies; skip restating the task or dumping large diffs.
- Prefer glob/agent-request rules over always-on; keep always-on rules tiny.
- When a task is done, stop — do not keep the chat open for memory (write a short rule/note instead).
